# What a player says about their own class: a complaint, a boast, a joke and a question for each of
# the 39 classes. Specialization names follow docs/bot-voices/RESEARCH-BRIEF.md section 5; reputations
# are period knowledge. Adds to classes.lines. New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

# ---------------- Albion ----------------
@kind ambient
@topic class
@realm alb
@who *
@class Armsman
@invites complaint
armsman endurance runs out right when the fight gets good
@invites boast
held three yellows off the healer tonight, she barely had to heal me
@invites joke
my armsman has more armor than personality, and that is a lot of armor
@invites ask_anyone
anyone run crossbow on their arms or is that just me?

@class Paladin
@invites complaint
everyone wants a paladin until they see our damage
@invites boast
four chants twisting and not one dropped, getting good at this
@invites joke
paladin: the only class that brings a choir to a sword fight
@invites ask_opinion
two handed or sword and board on a paladin, what do you think?

@class Mercenary
@invites complaint
merc solo is rough, i run out of health before they do
@invites boast
landed a double crit on a yellow, took a third of its health
@invites joke
mercs never retreat, we just swing in the other direction
@invites ask_advice
how much parry do you put on a merc?

@class Reaver
@invites complaint
nobody knows what a reaver does, including most reavers
@invites boast
soulrending lifetaps kept me up through a three add pull
@invites joke
flex whip, black armor, glowing eyes, but i am nice i promise
@invites ask_anyone
do reavers ever get group invites or is that a myth?

@class Scout
@invites complaint
solo scout is slow, you shoot and hope it never reaches you
@invites boast
three arrows, one dead caster, he never looked up
@invites joke
a scout's favorite spot in the group is as far away as possible
@invites ask_opinion
is it worth putting points in shields on a scout?

@class Infiltrator
@invites complaint
infil in a pve group is a lonely thing, nobody asks for us
@invites boast
perfect backstab chain, it never stood a chance
@invites joke
infils are shy, we prefer to stay out of sight
@invites ask_anyone
anyone else level their infil solo or am i doing it wrong?

@class Minstrel
@invites complaint
every group wants my speed song, nobody wants my opinion
@invites boast
mezzed three adds at once, the group never even noticed
@invites joke
my lute has been out of tune since level one
@invites ask_advice
what do you charm on a minstrel at this level?

@class Cleric
@invites complaint
whole group dead and my rez still on timer, story of my week
@invites boast
red con named, full group, nobody died. heals were on point
@invites joke
i was a smite cleric for one day, my group still talks about it
@invites ask_opinion
is enhancement worth it on a cleric or go full rejuv?

@class Friar
@invites complaint
friars got nerfed again, or maybe i just miss more now
@invites boast
staff and robes, took a yellow con without a scratch
@invites joke
friar robes, no armor, all faith
@invites ask_opinion
is friar the most fun class in albion or is it just me?

@class Wizard
@invites complaint
cloth armor, one add and i am a puddle
@invites boast
bolted a caster from max range, he never got a spell off
@invites joke
wizard rule one: set it on fire. rule two: run
@invites ask_opinion
cold spec wizard, worth it for the snare?

@class Theurgist
@invites complaint
the pet aggro is mine, the pet blame is also mine
@invites boast
earth pets held the whole room while i cast, theurg is doing great
@invites joke
theurg pets are like kids, they run off and you get the blame
@invites ask_opinion
earth, cold or wind theurg for leveling? i keep switching

@class Sorcerer
@invites complaint
my pet broke the mez again, i think it does that on purpose
@invites boast
mezzed the add, debuffed the pull, pet took the rest. clean
@invites joke
sorcerers put things to sleep, sometimes the group too
@invites ask_advice
how do you spec a body sorc for solo?

@class Cabalist
@invites complaint
cabalist damage is slow and the pet is slower
@invites boast
simulacrum tanked a yellow while i drained it, perfect fight
@invites joke
cabalists build friends from spare parts, ask me how
@invites ask_opinion
matter or spirit cab, which helps a group more?

@class Necromancer
@invites complaint
my real body just stands there while the shade does the work, nervous every time
@invites boast
soloed the whole camp with my pet, no healer needed
@invites joke
necromancer: not evil, just misunderstood. and a little bit dead
@invites ask_advice
what pet do you run at {level} as a necro?

# ---------------- Midgard ----------------
@kind ambient
@topic class
@realm mid
@who *
@class Warrior
@invites complaint
everyone wants a zerker, nobody remembers warriors exist
@invites boast
shield up, three adds, healer never had to look at me
@invites joke
warrior strategy: hit it until it stops moving
@invites ask_opinion
hammer or axe on a warrior?

@class Thane
@invites complaint
thanes go oom halfway through a fight, then we just swing
@invites boast
stormcalling crit took half its health, love this class
@invites joke
thane: a tank that thinks it is a caster
@invites ask_advice
how much stormcalling do you put on a thane?

@class Skald
@invites complaint
every group asks for speed first and hello second
@invites boast
nuke crit on a skald, they never see it coming
@invites joke
skalds sing, people run faster, nobody asks how
@invites ask_opinion
is a skald a real group class or just the speed?

@class Berserker
@invites complaint
they nerfed zerkers again, i barely know my own class
@invites boast
berserk popped, the yellow was gone before the healer cast
@invites joke
zerker defense: kill it before it kills you
@invites ask_opinion
zerker or savage, which one has more fun?

@class Savage
@invites complaint
savage buffs eat my health and then the healer yells at me
@invites boast
all buffs up, three kills in a row without sitting
@invites joke
savage: we punch first and ask about armor never
@invites ask_advice
how much parry does a savage really need?

@class Hunter
@invites complaint
my pet ran off and pulled half the camp again
@invites boast
two shots and it never reached me, hunter is in a good spot
@invites joke
hunters dont lose pets, we lend them to the monsters
@invites ask_opinion
spear or bow for a leveling hunter?

@class Shadowblade
@invites complaint
bring a shadowblade to a pve group and watch everyone sigh
@invites boast
evaded everything tonight, nothing touched me
@invites joke
shadowblades are always in the group, you just cant see us
@invites ask_advice
how do you level a sb without going mad?

@class Healer
@invites complaint
group dies, healer gets blamed. group lives, tank gets thanked
@invites boast
mezzed four adds on one pull, best save of the night
@invites joke
healer motto: i can fix you, i cannot fix your pulling
@invites ask_opinion
pac or mending healer for groups, what do you all think?

@class Shaman
@invites complaint
nobody remembers the shaman until the disease wears off
@invites boast
cave dots ticking on four mobs, they just melted
@invites joke
shamans, the only class that comes out of a cave on purpose
@invites ask_opinion
mending or cave shaman for a long leveling night?

@class Runemaster
@invites complaint
runemaster and a wall of adds, that is a short story
@invites boast
bolted it twice before it even crossed the room
@invites joke
runemasters write runes, then we write our wills
@invites ask_advice
how much suppression do you put on a rm?

@class Spiritmaster
@invites complaint
spirit pet died and left me holding a staff
@invites boast
mezzed two adds and the pet held the third, sm is doing great
@invites joke
spiritmasters talk to spirits, the spirits mostly ignore us
@invites ask_opinion
darkness or summoning sm for solo?

@class Bonedancer
@invites complaint
rebuffing every pet after a death takes forever
@invites boast
three pets, one bd, zero healer, cleared the whole camp
@invites joke
bonedancer family dinner: me and my skeletons
@invites ask_advice
what pets do you run as a bd at {level}?

# ---------------- Hibernia ----------------
@kind ambient
@topic class
@realm hib
@who *
@class Hero
@invites complaint
everyone wants a hero to tank, nobody wants to heal one
@invites boast
spear style chain landed, it never got to swing back
@invites joke
hero, because tank was already taken
@invites ask_opinion
spear or large weapons on a hero?

@class Champion
@invites complaint
nobody knows what a champ does until we leave the group
@invites boast
debuffed it, struck it, dropped it. champs are doing fine
@invites joke
champion: half fighter, half caster, fully confused
@invites ask_advice
how much valor do you put on a champ?

@class Blademaster
@invites complaint
bm life: great damage, zero respect
@invites boast
triple attack on a blue con, it never had a chance
@invites joke
blademasters count to two a lot
@invites ask_opinion
is parry worth it on a blademaster or all in on dual?

@class Warden
@invites complaint
wardens are the realm's best kept secret, way too well kept
@invites boast
kept the tank up through a three add pull, warden heals are plenty
@invites joke
warden: heals in one hand, sword in the other, no idea which to use
@invites ask_opinion
nurture or regrowth warden for groups?

@class Druid
@invites complaint
my pet dies, i resummon, it dies again. druid life
@invites boast
pet tanked a yellow while i healed it, solo druid is easy mode
@invites joke
druids talk to trees, the trees mostly agree with us
@invites ask_opinion
regrowth or nature druid for leveling?

@class Bard
@invites complaint
every group wants a bard, then complains when i mez the wrong one
@invites boast
mez on the adds, heal on the tank and speed home, all in one fight
@invites joke
bards do everything, mostly badly, always loudly
@invites ask_advice
how much music do you put on a bard?

@class Ranger
@invites complaint
rangers get blamed for everything scouts did
@invites boast
pulled from max range, two arrows, dead before it arrived
@invites joke
rangers never get lost, we are pathfinding
@invites ask_opinion
bow ranger or dual ranger for groups?

@class Nightshade
@invites complaint
nightshade in a pve group, nobody wants us and nobody says why
@invites boast
backstab crit on a blue con, gone in one hit
@invites joke
nightshades are great at hide and seek, mostly the hide part
@invites ask_advice
how do you solo a nightshade past 30?

@class Eldritch
@invites complaint
one add and my eldritch is on the floor
@invites boast
light bolt took half its health before it even moved
@invites joke
eldritch: bright robes, brighter spells, very short life
@invites ask_opinion
void or light eld for leveling?

@class Enchanter
@invites complaint
pbaoe enchanter means every add is my fault
@invites boast
pbaoe on six mobs and they all dropped together
@invites joke
enchanter rule: if we stand next to you, something bad is about to happen
@invites ask_opinion
is the enchanter pet worth leveling with or just a buffbot?

@class Mentalist
@invites complaint
mentalist heals help a bit, mez helps a bit, nobody says thanks a bit
@invites boast
mezzed the add and healed the tank in the same fight, ment is underrated
@invites joke
mentalists read minds, mostly the minds of very hungry monsters
@invites ask_opinion
mentalism or mana ment for groups?

@class Animist
@invites complaint
my shrooms take one hit and pop, i need more of them
@invites boast
five shrooms on a hill and nothing got past
@invites joke
animist strategy: plant mushrooms, hide behind mushrooms
@invites ask_opinion
arboreal or creeping animist for solo?

@class Valewalker
@invites complaint
people think a valewalker is a druid with a farm tool
@invites boast
one scythe swing hit two mobs at once, vw is better than people think
@invites joke
valewalker: i bring the scythe, nature brings the harvest
@invites ask_advice
how do you build a valewalker for groups?
